# IMPORTANT VIVA QUESTIONS

## What is ELB?

Elastic Load Balancer distributes incoming traffic among multiple servers.

---

## What is ASG?

Auto Scaling Group automatically increases/decreases EC2 instances.

---

## What is Health Check?

It detects unhealthy instances and removes them from traffic.

---

## Difference Between ELB and ASG?

| ELB                 | ASG                    |
| ------------------- | ---------------------- |
| Distributes traffic | Manages instance count |
| High availability   | Auto scaling           |



